    "title": "Mirror with Light and Video",
    "description": "Mirror with Light and Video makes your life easier with super useful features. Check your look, take photos, record videos and share with your friends, with excellent camera quality.\r\n\r\nSuper easy to show off your hairstyle, your clothes, your style, do your makeup, shave your beard, and much more.\r\n\r\nWhy is this app better than just using the front camera (selfie)?\r\n- Has a brighter image in light mode\r\n- Quick and convenient exposure and zoom adjustments\r\n- Make 360\u00b0 videos quickly\r\n- Freeze the image without having to take a photo\r\n- Exceptional camera quality\r\n- Intuitive and super simple to use adjustments\r\n\r\nNever worry about carrying a mirror in your bag again. Download this super light and useful application now.",
